  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070160,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "ごめんね、めぐるちゃん\r\n買ってきてくれてありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070160"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ありがとう、めぐる",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070170"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん、どういたしまして！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070180"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "んく、んく……んー！　今日のジュースは美味しいなぁ！\r\n勝利の祝杯の味、って感じ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070190"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まだ何も勝ってないでしょ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070200"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いやいや、勝ってるんだよ！\r\nたとえばほら──昨日のわたしたちとかにはさ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070210"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070220,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "そっかぁ、ほんとだね。私たち、昨日より……\r\nちょっとかもしれないけど、成長してる、もんね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070220"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それじゃあ、毎日お祝いのジュースが必要になりそう",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070230"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "おおっ、灯織もちゃんと毎日成長してるって\r\n実感してるんだ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070240"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070250,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、今のは──そういう気持ちでやらなきゃって話で……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070250"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんうんっ！　これからも1歩ずつ、\r\nみんなで一緒に頑張っていこうね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070260"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070270,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……もう",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070270"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070280,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "……でも、めぐるちゃんの言う通りだよ\r\n私たちみんなで、進んでいかなくちゃ",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070280"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070290,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんもはづきさんも、\r\nさっき、すごく喜んでくれてたし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070290"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう！\r\nこの調子だって、すっごく応援してくれたよねっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070300"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070310,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうだね……応援してくれる人、支えてくれる人のためにも\r\nいいステージを見せられるアイドルにならないと",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070310"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070320,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "自分たちの力だけじゃ、ここまで来られなかったんだから\r\n……恩返し、しなくちゃ",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070320"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたちのステージで、みんな笑顔になってくれたら……\r\n恩返しになるかな？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070330"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070340,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "──ステージで恩返しをするのがアイドルの仕事でしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070340"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070350,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、これからもレッスンを頑張ろう",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070350"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070360,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それで結果を出して、\r\nさすが２８３プロのアイドルだって、言われたい",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070360"
  },
