  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070380,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "私たち、ユニットを組んだばっかりで……",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070380"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070390,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "デビューライブだってまだだし、\r\n『W.I.N.G.』なんて、遠い未来の話みたいに思えちゃうけど",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070390"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070400,
    "speaker": "真乃",
    "text": "これからも……３人なら、上手くできるよね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "mano",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070400"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070410,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もちろん！　大丈夫だよ！\r\n一緒ならなんだってできちゃうって、わたしは思うな！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070410"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070420,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ちょっと。油断大敵、でしょ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070420"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070430,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……でも、私もめぐるの意見に賛成\r\n３人一緒なら、きっと……どこまででもいけると思う",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "game_event_communications/400100107/4001001070430"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001001070440,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だって、私たちが目指してるのは──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
